<title>EL SALVADOR: SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT EL SALVADOR 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT EL SALVADOR 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico beat El Salvador 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a CONCACAF zone final round World Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Luis Garcia (40)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points)  Mexico		5  3  2  0 13  2 11</p>
<p> Costa Rica	  5  2  1  2  7  6  7</p>
<p> United States     4  1  2  1  7  5  5</p>
<p> Canada		4  1  2  2  1  7  5</p>
<p> Jamaica	     5  1  2  2  2  9  5</p>
<p> El Salvador	 4  1  1  2  2  3  4</p>
<p>Next match: June 29 - El Salvador v United States</p>
<p>Note: top three teams qualify for the World Cup.</p>
</text>
